  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Added _hf_noise.suppress_hf_noise() that runs at sketch_embeddings import, setting HF_HUB_DISABLE_PROGRESS_BARS, TRANSFORMERS_VERBOSITY, HF_HUB_DISABLE_SYMLINKS_WARNING, TRANSFORMERS_NO_ADVISORY_WARNINGS via setdefault. Extracted to a separate module so the suppression is coverage-tested (sketch_embeddings.py is intentionally omitted from coverage because its loaders need heavy ML deps). 7 unit tests, 100% coverage on new module."  # af89
